<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns secondary credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Friday</p>
<p>assigned the single credit auction it had offered, injecting</p>
<p>369 million pesos into the secondary market, dealer said.</p>
<p>The auction was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    369 million    3 days   19.02 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
